<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus Christ in our experience</l><l>Is the worship God desires;</l><l>This true worshipping in spirit</l><l>Is the service God requires.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Serving Christ, just let Him kiss you,</l><l>Living with Him all the day,</l><l>Worshipping God by our living</l><l>Is the gospel-serving way.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
